  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24></style>5 <style=coinColor>50 x total bet</style>

      </style>4 <style=coinColor>10 x total bet</style>

      </style>3 <style=coinColor>5 x total bet</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_SCATTER_FORMAT
    value: <style=coinColor><size=32><b>Prime Bucks</b></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: <style=coinColor><size=32><b>{0:CommaNumber}</b></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>Prime Bucks</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>Prime Bucks Gamble</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>Gamble Multiplier</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>Gamble Multiplier</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>Lucky Credit</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=20>\n-  3                        symbols in a winning line triggers
      the Prime Bucks feature.\n\n-  Prime Bucks awards a random amount of credit
      prize with the 3 following options:\n\n       -  Take Offer: Take offer and
      end the Bonus.\n\n       -  Try Again: Try again for a different credit prize.\n\n
      \      -  Gamble: Gamble for a chance to make the credit prize win even bigger!\n\n-
      \ Player may Try Again up to 3 times. The 4th credit prize cannot be refreshed
      anymore.\n\n-  Gamble may only be exercised when the player has a multiplier
      activated from Base Game.\n\n-  If player chooses to Gamble, begin the Prime
      Bucks Gamble Wheel."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=19>\n-  Prime Bucks Gamble Wheel begins when player chooses to Gamble
      from the Prime Bucks feature.\n\n-  Gamble Wheel will determine if the player
      can multiply the total credit prize to win even bigger.\n\n      -  If player
      wins, the total credit prize is multiplied by the gamble multiplier from Base
      Game.\n\n      -  If player loses, the original credit prize is awarded.\n\n-
      \ The gamble multiplier in base game is reset once the gamble feature ends."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: '<size=18>

      -  Gamble Multiplier can be activated by collecting                from the
      reels.


      -  Collect               to activate x2, x4, x6, x8, x10 multipliers, in that
      order.


      -  Initially, no multiplier is active.


      -  Once the multipliers increase, the previous active multiplier is no longer
      active.


      -  Once the player is at x10 multiplier,               is no longer collected.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_2
    value: '<size=18>

      -  A random Lucky Credit is awarded when the player collects a              .


      -  Once the x10 Multiplier is active, Lucky Credit prizes increase.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff></size>5 LINES</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_8
    value: <size=36>1 or more             in each reel triggers Free Games.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_COMBI_3
    value: <size=24>ANY SEVEN</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_SCATTER_PAY
    value: <size=24>ANY BAR</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO_1
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=18>- When triggered, sum of coin values on all initial                      symbols
      becomes the starting  bonus   \n   award amount.\n\n- During Free Games, only
      \                 ,                ,  and                 symbols appear as
      collect symbols. \n   Depending on the total number of Fireball symbols collected,
      Multiplier will be applied to the final \n   bonus award amount. \n            \n
      \              Is a Collect symbol.\n               Is also a Collect symbol,
      but appears with a coin amount, which is added to the starting bonus\n               award.
      \n               Is also a Collect symbol and awards +1 Free Spin."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><color=#00eaff><size=42>LINES</style>
